§ `s 492.28 -- the period that begins on one day and ends on another: the helper, asked of one day`
-- begins on 10 January 2026, ends on 20 February 2026; both end days are in the period (fork F7)
#ASSERT `s 492.28 the day falls within the period that begins on one day and ends on another` (Date 9 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 492.28 the day falls within the period that begins on one day and ends on another` (Date 10 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 492.28 the day falls within the period that begins on one day and ends on another` (Date 15 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 492.28 the day falls within the period that begins on one day and ends on another` (Date 20 2 2026) (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 492.28 the day falls within the period that begins on one day and ends on another` (Date 21 2 2026) (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the period has begun and has not ended: a day before it began is outside it; a day on or after the beginning is not covered (the end day is not yet fixed)
#ASSERT `s 492.28 the day falls within the period that begins on one day and ends on another` (Date 9 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026) NOTHING EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 492.28 the day falls within the period that begins on one day and ends on another` (Date 10 1 2026) (Date 10 1 2026) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 492.28 the day falls within the period that begins on one day and ends on another` (Date 1 3 2026) (Date 10 1 2026) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 492.28(a) -- an objection under subsection 37(1) of the Canada Evidence Act before a superior court`
-- the objection made on 10 January 2026 and finally determined on 20 February 2026
#ASSERT `s 492.28(a) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 9 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 492.28(a) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 10 1 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 492.28(a) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 20 2 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 492.28(a) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 21 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the objection was not made before a superior court under subsection 37(1): the paragraph's scope is not met, not covered
#ASSERT `s 492.28(a) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- not determining whether there has been or will be unreasonable delay
#ASSERT `s 492.28(a) the court shall not take the day into account` FALSE (JUST FALSE) TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- the day is within the period but s 492.3 applies: not covered
#ASSERT `s 492.28(a) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- the objection is not yet finally determined: a day on or after it was made is not covered
#ASSERT `s 492.28(a) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) NOTHING (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 492.28(b) -- an objection under subsection 37(1) before a court, person or body other than a superior court, and an application under subsection 37(3)`
-- the objection made on 10 January 2026; the application under subsection 37(3) finally determined on 20 February 2026
#ASSERT `s 492.28(b) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 9 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 492.28(b) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 10 1 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 492.28(b) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 20 2 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 492.28(b) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 21 2 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "in the case where": either condition failing is the text's no (ruling of 2026-11-05 (b))
#ASSERT `s 492.28(b) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 492.28(b) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE FALSE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 492.28(b) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) FALSE FALSE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not determining; s 492.3 applying; the application not yet determined
#ASSERT `s 492.28(b) the court shall not take the day into account` FALSE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 492.28(b) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) (JUST (Date 20 2 2026)) (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 492.28(b) the court shall not take the day into account` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE (Date 10 1 2026) NOTHING (Date 15 1 2026) EQUALS NOTHING

